{"data":{"projects":{"nodes":[{"id":"63124b17-13c9-558d-84fa-3d01d7ee4c96","html":"<p>Developed a Python-based control system for the Pluto Drone, featuring a low-latency MSP socket interface (~40 ms). Built a RealSense + ArUco tag localization pipeline with 95% accuracy and designed a vision-based PID controller that enabled stable trajectory following with ~7% overshoot.</p>","frontmatter":{"label":null,"title":"Pluto Drone Control and Trajectory Planning","tech":["Python","PIDControl","ArUco","MSP"],"github":"https://github.com/a-daksh/Pluto-Drone-Control","external":null,"cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#b8b8b8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/5181889c80a345b39fac32444df15eba/ee256/cover.jpg","srcSet":"/static/5181889c80a345b39fac32444df15eba/834b4/cover.jpg 175w,\n/static/5181889c80a345b39fac32444df15eba/d15ba/cover.jpg 350w,\n/static/5181889c80a345b39fac32444df15eba/ee256/cover.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/5181889c80a345b39fac32444df15eba/0823c/cover.webp 175w,\n/static/5181889c80a345b39fac32444df15eba/5890a/cover.webp 350w,\n/static/5181889c80a345b39fac32444df15eba/8ceca/cover.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"video":{"publicURL":"/static/3c0d39e36459332fb5109334363b0fa0/video.mp4"}}},{"id":"4bcbde0b-3a5a-59b2-9461-c6371bba4b1c","html":"<p>Developed a Raspberry Pi–based wearable to improve spatial hearing for individuals with hearing impairment. Designed a 4-microphone TDoA system that achieved 10° directional resolution, and integrated haptic motors to provide tactile feedback of sound direction. This reduced user response time by 30%, enabling faster localization of alarming sounds.</p>","frontmatter":{"label":null,"title":"Directional Tactile Device for the Hearing Impaired","tech":["TDoA","RaspberryPi","Python"],"github":"https://github.com/a-daksh/Directional-Assistive-device-for-deaf","external":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ADwG2qgMqMwadstKHuSLamN3B5sjKGv8/view","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#c8b898","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/fc7f987c2168335fa558e9d95bbfc451/ee256/cover.jpg","srcSet":"/static/fc7f987c2168335fa558e9d95bbfc451/834b4/cover.jpg 175w,\n/static/fc7f987c2168335fa558e9d95bbfc451/d15ba/cover.jpg 350w,\n/static/fc7f987c2168335fa558e9d95bbfc451/ee256/cover.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/fc7f987c2168335fa558e9d95bbfc451/0823c/cover.webp 175w,\n/static/fc7f987c2168335fa558e9d95bbfc451/5890a/cover.webp 350w,\n/static/fc7f987c2168335fa558e9d95bbfc451/8ceca/cover.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"video":{"publicURL":"/static/e7ffaf0eb49f1b5e2e7e13bcb2345f84/video.mp4"}}},{"id":"4da09bfd-c5f6-51c7-9a84-f9c4de12fb15","html":"<p>Manufactured a Mars Rover capable of navigating and housing soil samples. Employed ANSYS structural analysis to evaluate multiple chassis geometries and materials, optimizing for strength and weight. Designed for the IRC 2021–22 space robotics engineering challenge, organized by Mars Society South Asia.</p>","frontmatter":{"label":null,"title":"YUVAAN: Mars Rover","tech":["CAD","ANSYS"],"github":"https://github.com/a-daksh/YUVAAN-IITG","external":"https://www.instagram.com/yuvaan_iitg/","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#684838","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/ee256/cover.jpg","srcSet":"/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/834b4/cover.jpg 175w,\n/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/d15ba/cover.jpg 350w,\n/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/ee256/cover.jpg 700w,\n/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/5cc47/cover.jpg 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/0823c/cover.webp 175w,\n/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/5890a/cover.webp 350w,\n/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/8ceca/cover.webp 700w,\n/static/75c85afbf0ad901362c96b0d60b6f4bb/f0297/cover.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"video":null}},{"id":"f636212e-bcaa-5c2d-be2c-09592eca0190","html":"<p>Built a biomimetic robotic fish for underwater exploration, designed to perform surveillance and mapping tasks with agile tail-driven propulsion. Developed the control system on Raspberry Pi to coordinate tail oscillation and buoyancy adjustments, enabling smooth underwater navigation and stability.</p>","frontmatter":{"label":null,"title":"Bio-Inspired Robotic Fish","tech":["RaspberryPi","Open-loop-control","SolidWorks"],"github":"https://github.com/a-daksh/Bio-Inspired-Robotic-Fish","external":null,"cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#181818","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/ee256/cover.jpg","srcSet":"/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/834b4/cover.jpg 175w,\n/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/d15ba/cover.jpg 350w,\n/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/ee256/cover.jpg 700w,\n/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/5cc47/cover.jpg 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/0823c/cover.webp 175w,\n/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/5890a/cover.webp 350w,\n/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/8ceca/cover.webp 700w,\n/static/865a0e4888f3e7cb81b4b05fa08da291/f0297/cover.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"video":null}},{"id":"5b69e787-de04-54a0-9ee8-ad2d81fbdaa4","html":"<p>Built a 3D model for an autonomous in-pipe robot leveraging a screw-drive mechanism for smooth traversal through curved and irregular pipeline interiors. Using an onboard Raspberry Pi and camera, implemented Canny edge detection in OpenCV to identify cracks and leaks in real time.</p>","frontmatter":{"label":null,"title":"Pipe Traversing Robot","tech":["Fusion 360","OpenCV"],"github":"https://github.com/a-daksh/Pipe-Traversing-Robot","external":null,"cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#686868","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/786c942e54ab8b540c22d9ef5a259b81/ee256/cover.jpg","srcSet":"/static/786c942e54ab8b540c22d9ef5a259b81/834b4/cover.jpg 175w,\n/static/786c942e54ab8b540c22d9ef5a259b81/d15ba/cover.jpg 350w,\n/static/786c942e54ab8b540c22d9ef5a259b81/ee256/cover.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/786c942e54ab8b540c22d9ef5a259b81/0823c/cover.webp 175w,\n/static/786c942e54ab8b540c22d9ef5a259b81/5890a/cover.webp 350w,\n/static/786c942e54ab8b540c22d9ef5a259b81/8ceca/cover.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"video":{"publicURL":"/static/e7fbc9255e05e31227b14ec8a3bf2191/video.mp4"}}},{"id":"66118e94-a480-5edd-ac38-aa7a7a6c256f","html":"<p>Implemented a dual-camera sensor fusion system for hand tracking using Kalman filters, significantly improving joint angle estimation. Leveraged MediaPipe for accurate hand pose detection without camera calibration and integrated YOLO for real-time hand–object interaction tracking, evaluating performance with the Grasp Quality Index.</p>","frontmatter":{"label":null,"title":"Kalman Filter-Based Multi-Camera Hand Tracking","tech":["Kalman Filter","YOLO","MediaPipe","Computer Vision"],"github":"https://github.com/a-daksh/Kalman_Filter_Based_Sensor_Fusion_for_Multi_Camera_Hand_Tracking","external":null,"cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/39b16/cover.png","srcSet":"/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/6abf8/cover.png 175w,\n/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/1bd8c/cover.png 350w,\n/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/39b16/cover.png 700w,\n/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/b9ee1/cover.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/e03a0/cover.webp 175w,\n/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/79fa8/cover.webp 350w,\n/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/1ccb1/cover.webp 700w,\n/static/2c826332e44e856c1dd9f2067f97ea8a/7e0db/cover.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":344}}},"video":null}}]}}}